  "releaseNotes": "**DI001 Disposal-Proof Precision**: DI001 now reports scopes whose only `Dispose()` / `DisposeAsync()` proof is guarded by a conditional branch, switch section, loop, or catch block, while preserving straight-line and `finally` disposal patterns. | **DI001 Regression Coverage**: Added focused analyzer guardrails for conditional and catch-only disposal so the rule no longer suppresses leaks just because a later disposal call appears syntactically in the method.",
